     1	# AGENTS.md — coco-mining-sim (instructions for Codex and other agents)
     2	
     3	Roblox mining simulator (Luau + Rojo). Owner: SkyTmin (not a programmer, Russian-speaking). Codex writes the code
     4	from task specs (ТЗ) in `docs/tz/`; Claude writes the specs and reviews every stage before the next one starts.
     5	
     6	## Read first, in this order
     7	
     8	1. `docs/PROGRESS.md` — current stage, what is done, what is next.
     9	2. The ТЗ of the current stage: `docs/tz/TZ-NN-*.md`. **Do only what that ТЗ asks.** Anything outside it → write it
    10	   in the stage report as a proposal, do not build it.
    11	3. Design canon (Russian): `docs/design/wiki/00-README.md` (glossary + index). Open only the wiki files the ТЗ names.
    12	   **Precedence:** the ТЗ → `wiki/18-balans-chisla.md` (all numbers, pickaxes, families, shop) and
    13	   `wiki/19-lager-shakhta-i-lyudi.md` (camp, 8 players, social) → wiki files 01–17. Stage order: `docs/tz/README.md`.
    14	   Balance data lives in `scripts/balance/data.mjs`; from stage 3 it feeds `scripts/design-decisions.json`.
    15	   `docs/design/studio/*` are raw research behind the wiki — read only when the ТЗ points there.
    16	4. Для живых картин применяй [правило первой версии](.agents/skills/pixel-bosses/references/0-quick.md#поведение-в-первой-версии-картины)
    17	   при постановке действий героя и перед показом картины владельцу.
    18	
    19	## Where things come from
    20	
    21	- `reference/katorga/` — read-only copies of files from the owner's previous game «Каторга»
    22	  (github.com/SkyTmin/coco-prison-roblox, branch `stage-1`). Port from them; **never** edit them, never let Rojo build
    23	  them (they are outside `src/`). When you port a file, strip everything the new game does not have (needs, hunger,
    24	  combat, bosses, factions, locations, old mine) instead of copying it as is.
    25	- `reference/prototype/tunnel-game.html` — the owner's HTML prototype of the tunnel. The owner liked its lightning a lot.
    26	  Use it for the look/feel of the lightning and the wall ride; its data model (`class Mine`) is replaced by the one in
    27	  `docs/tz/TZ-01`.
    28	
    29	## Hard rules
    30	
    31	1. **Server owns every outcome.** Clients send intents (`Hit(x, y, dRel)`), never amounts. Validate type, range,
    32	   rate (token bucket), ownership of the plot, visibility of the cell. Rejected intents are dropped silently (`reject(seq)`),
    33	   no kicks.
    34	2. **Profile mutations only via `ProfileService.Mutate`.** A failed load sets `loadFailed` and is never saved.
    35	3. `--!strict` in every Luau file. Pure logic in `src/shared/Mine` and `src/shared/Play` must not touch `game` or any
    36	   Instance — it runs in Lune (tests, simulator) as well as in Roblox.
    37	4. Before every commit: `stylua --check src tests`, `rojo build -o build/game.rbxl`, `lune run tests`. All green.
    38	   `selene src` too when it runs in your environment (it needs a Roblox API dump; if it cannot run, say so in the report).
    39	5. **Generated configs are never hand-edited.** Edit `scripts/design-decisions.json`, run `node scripts/build-configs.mjs`.
    40	   The build must fail loudly on invalid data (rules in the ТЗ).
    41	6. Every player-facing string goes into `src/shared/Strings` in **four locales: en (default), ru, es, fr**. No hard-coded
    42	   UI text.
    43	7. Numbers in configs/docs carry a source tag in a `_note`/`_why` field: `[владелец]`, `[решение]`, `[вики]`.
    44	8. Never publish the place and never touch Roblox experience settings — the owner does Save/Publish.
    45	9. Original game: genre mechanics are fine; never copy assets, names or levels of a specific existing game.
    46	   «Better Combat» animations are All Rights Reserved — never use them.
    47	11. **Never take control of the owner's desktop** [владелец 10.11]: no Windows app automation, no mouse/keyboard input, no
    48	    bringing windows to the foreground. Screenshots only by Studio's own means (in-Studio capture, `CaptureService`). If a
    49	    screenshot is impossible without that — skip it and say so in the report.
    50	12. **Sound is a key quality bar** [владелец 10.11]: frequent sounds are soft and quiet, nothing harsh or loud, no stock
    51	    explosion/thunder samples; rules in `docs/tz/TZ-02b-oshchushchenie.md` §3 apply to every later stage.
    52	14. **Leave the latest build in the Studio place** (`87020443315503`) after your checks [владелец 10.11]: never strip the
    53	    project scripts or «restore the original scene» — the owner presses Play right after you. Remove only your own
    54	    temporary test scripts.
    55	13. The owner plays in Russian: every new string must have a real `ru` translation in the same commit.
    56	10. Children are the audience: no free text input, no dark patterns, paid random items show odds before purchase.
    57	
    58	## Conventions
    59	
    60	- Code, identifiers and code comments: English. Docs, commit messages, stage reports: Russian.
    61	- Commit messages short, Russian, typed: `feat(mine): …`, `fix(net): …`, `test(mine): …`, `docs: …`.
    62	- One stage = one branch `stage-NN` (from `main`), commits as you go, PR to `main` at the end of the stage.
    63	  Do not merge — Claude reviews and merges after acceptance [владелец 10.11].
    64	- At the end of a stage append to `docs/PROGRESS.md`: what was done, how it was checked (commands + output summary),
    65	  what is not done or deviates from the ТЗ, measured numbers (timings, sizes). Honest: a failing check is reported as
    66	  failing.
    67	- Tools are pinned in `rokit.toml`. Lune `lune-org/lune@0.10.4`. If a tool cannot be installed in your environment,
    68	  stop and report it instead of working around it silently.
    69	
    70	## Layout (target, see TZ-00)
    71	
    72	```
    73	src/first/   loading screen            src/shared/   Config/ (generated) Config.luau Strings/ Remotes.luau Types.luau Format.luau
